      "title": "4.4 Hive lit les fichiers de Spark",
      "text": "%hive\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS nb_clients, COUNT(DISTINCT ville) AS nb_villes, ROUND(SUM(ca_total), 2) AS ca_total\nFROM referentiel.clients_spark",
